7
Hallo Welt!zwei
Hallo Welt!zwei
Hallo Welt!zwei
Hallo Welt!
Welt
zwei

== innerHTML reading, with escaping
-- html
<div id=d><p title="a&quot;b">1 &lt; 2 &amp; 3</p><br><img src=x alt="y"></div>
-- ask
inner 3
outer 4
outer 5
outer 6
-- want
<p title="a&quot;b">1 &lt; 2 &amp; 3</p><br><img src="x" alt="y">
<p title="a&quot;b">1 &lt; 2 &amp; 3</p>
<br>
<img src="x" alt="y">

== raw text elements are not escaped again
-- html
<body><style>i > b { color: red }</style><script>if (a < b) {}</script><p>a < b</p>
-- ask
outer 3
outer 4
outer 5
-- want
<style>i > b { color: red }</style>
<script>if (a < b) {}</script>
<p>a &lt; b</p>

== attributes and namespaces
